'' A MEMBER WRITTEN ABOVE A LOCAL OF THE SAME NAME. Collect declared the method's locals
'' before anything was bound, so 'total = 5' on the line above 'dim as long total' bound
'' the LATER local -- a store into a slot nothing reads -- where fbc-modern writes the
'' member and prints '100 5'. AfxNova's DVARIANT.ToGuidStr writes exactly this shape with
'' m_Result. A name declared below its use is not visible to it (resolveunbound.bas), so
'' the lookup goes on to the member, through 'this'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/member-above-local.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-OUT: %5 = field.addr %4, 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: store %5, %7
